Duplicate Emails – SQL Solution

📌 Project Overview
This project demonstrates how to identify duplicate email addresses in a database using SQL.

The solution uses the GROUP BY and HAVING clauses along with the COUNT() aggregate function to find email addresses that appear more than once.

🎯 Problem Statement

Write an SQL query to report all duplicate email addresses from a table named Person. Each email address is non-null.

📊 Database Structure

Table: Person

Column Name

Data Type

id

INT

email

VARCHAR

id is the primary key.

email contains the email addresses of individuals.
